                                "sense_id": "06bd041d-ce4e-309b-8984-4ad7b435a59a",
                                "text": "Dianas lip\nIs not more ſmooth, and rubious: thy ſmall pipe\nIs as the maidens organ, ſhrill, and ſound,\nAnd all is ſemblatiue a womans part."
