                                "sense_id": "06bd041d-ce4e-309b-8984-4ad7b435a59a",
                                "text": "As Shaw became less of the rubious-bearded rebel and more of the Public Institution, reporter-hunted, bore-pursued, the partnership must have been hard work at times."
